#: ../../source/concat-stream_readme.md:1
msgid "concat-stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concat-stream_readme.md:3
msgid ""
"Writable stream that concatenates all the data from a stream and calls a "
"callback with the result. Use this when you want to collect all the data "
"from a stream into a single buffer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concat-stream_readme.md:5
msgid ""
"[![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/maxogden/concat-"
"stream.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/maxogden/concat-stream)"
msgstr ""

